#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:1
#: f384f4e5f6594241a9aa9607be236838
msgid "查找非物理结构（Find non-physical structures）"
msgstr "Find non-physical structures"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:3
#: 87e5c99feb4b46f9be4a30d6b88c0c79
msgid "界面按钮：`查找非物理结构`。"
msgstr "Toolbar action: `Find non-physical structures`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:5
#: 13890df74d804a4198a09d4f8ae5df60
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:7
#: 826c8a45732c4105bddd08534b434c29
msgid "按近邻距离扫描当前活动结构，选中疑似存在原子重叠或异常短接触的构型。适合检查强扰动、 随机缺陷、表面吸附和随机堆积产生的候选池。"
msgstr ""
"Scan active structures by neighbor distance and select configurations "
"that may contain overlapping atoms or anomalously short contacts. Use it "
"to review candidate pools produced by strong perturbations, random "
"defects, surface adsorption, or random packing."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:10
#: 394922e9db3b422897c71cc55497d393
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:12
#: e40ef237327b439cb0c70c4c7ab29559
msgid "对每一对元素 $A,B$，程序用共价半径之和给出元素相关的距离下限："
msgstr ""
"For each element pair $A,B$, the program derives an element-dependent "
"distance limit from the sum of covalent radii:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:14
#: 50d51565c34c42c8bb797c5fdc9dd78d
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A,B)=c_r\\left[r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(A)+r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(B)\\right],"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A,B)=c_r\\left[r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(A)+r_{\\mathrm{cov}}(B)\\right],"
"\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:18
#: 5a8add1116e8486391477950bef00895
msgid ""
"其中 $r_{\\mathrm{cov}}$ 是共价半径，$c_r$ 是界面设置中的半径系数，默认 0.7。 "
"程序在周期边界条件下扫描原子对；只要存在"
msgstr ""
"Here $r_{\\mathrm{cov}}$ is the covalent radius and $c_r$ is the radius "
"coefficient from the interface, default 0.7. The program scans atom pairs"
" under periodic boundary conditions; whenever"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:21
#: e0a8be8f669e42a0ae0d93341218f5bd
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_{ij}<r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A_i,A_j),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_{ij}<r_{\\mathrm{limit}}(A_i,A_j),\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:25
#: 36e7d1be61694f01bf6afeae003cecda
msgid "该结构就会被选中。与统一的绝对距离阈值相比，这种判据会随元素尺寸变化，但它仍不知道 键级、压力或特殊化学环境，因此只能称为“疑似非物理”。"
msgstr ""
"the structure is selected. Unlike one universal absolute-distance "
"threshold, this criterion adapts to element size. It still knows nothing "
"about bond order, pressure, or unusual chemical environments, so the "
"result is only a suspected nonphysical structure."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:28
#: 8ee576fdd3364800b3ef582d6833238d
msgid "判定与结果"
msgstr "Criterion and Result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6613
#: 9f9b8de2a9684eb1b8841ec13d46b67d
msgid "判定阈值：使用 `设置` 中的半径系数（默认 `0.7`）。两原子距离小于其共价半径之和乘以该系数时视为过近。"
msgstr "Threshold: uses the radius coefficient in `Settings` (default `0.7`). Two atoms count as too close when their distance is below the sum of their covalent radii times this coefficient."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6614
#: f83daace0482400292738e1da13689e9
msgid "执行结果：扫描后选中疑似非物理结构。"
msgstr ""
"Result: select structures flagged as potentially nonphysical after the "
"scan."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:35
#: d203e0c8de65478b98d3b03bb66ea3a6
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-nonphysical.md:37
#: d4f002654b0e4d85a65ff1d721d7fa65
msgid "扫描结果只是复核集合，不会自动删除。逐个查看最短键长和局部几何；高压结构或特殊成键体系 可能具有真实的短距离，不能只因被选中就判为坏结构。"
msgstr ""
"The scan produces a review set and never deletes automatically. Inspect "
"the shortest bond and local geometry of each structure. High-pressure "
"structures or unusual bonding systems can have genuinely short distances,"
" so selection alone does not make a structure invalid."

#~ msgid "参数来源：`widget.radius_coefficient`（默认 `0.7`）。"
#~ msgstr "Parameter source: `widget.radius_coefficient` (default `0.7`)."
